    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d73">

                <pb facs="0257" n="887" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v2/pg887"/>

                <head>No. 379.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">General Sickles to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-01-30"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 30,
                        1873</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In view of the frequent interruption of communications by telegraph and post
                    between Madrid and the frontier, and having reasons to anticipate very soon a
                    change in the form of this government, I beg you to instruct me as to my line of
                    conduct in case the existing Congress shall declare itself a convention and
                    appoint a new executive.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>SICKLES.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
